From 77acc98e49c7d59bb331cc35a89a80fd7549175e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:32:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 85/87] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: CCI transfer retry,
 rmnet

Add kernel 0170: the CCI driver runs a transfer again when it times out;
the timeout at boot hit the IMX586 as well as the IMX471 and left all
cameras unregistered. Enable CONFIG_RMNET (with CONFIG_ETHERNET and
CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_QUALCOMM, which it sits under): ModemManager needs it to
multiplex the connections of the SDX55.
---
 ...-cci-Retry-a-transfer-that-timed-out.patch | 75 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/APKBUILD   |  6 +-
 .../config-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250.aarch64   |  4 +-
 3 files changed, 82 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0170-i2c-qcom-cci-Retry-a-transfer-that-timed-out.patch

